(defn terminal
  "Opens an interactive terminal for this container using its configured default terminal command if not overridden by args (or sh as a fallback default).\nOptions: :cmd, :disable-dagger-in-dagger, :experimental-privileged-nesting, :insecure-root-capabilities"
